; LAV TACTICAL ENGINE, the core system (design 1.4): two actions, each in its own usage group.
; STALK THE HORIZON is the passive - an entire_movement PRE reaction that spends the point, 2/round
; - and IS the card's passive line, so the Kit's `.effect` row is that sentence and the reaction's
; duplicate row hides. REND THAT WHICH IS CRUEL AND UNNATURAL is the active (QUICK, consumes_cp) and
; hangs buff_cruel_and_unnatural. SP5: the REND family (the chip wears it) plus the Kit's own bare
; glyph; STALK reaches no player-facing surface today (its row duplicates the Kit's, so it hides),
; and whether it gets a trigger row and a glyph of its own is SP5's call - see
; test_content_integrity.gd's ICON_TARGETS row.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_kit")
actions = Array[ExtResource("2_action")]([ExtResource("3_stalk"), ExtResource("4_rend")])
is_trait = true
